        "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:14:06.438Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Respected Team of IIT Madras BS Program</p>\n<p>I am reaching out to request about the postponement of my OPPE exam of System Commands because I’m suffering from a severe cold and high fever which has also resulted in trouble in breathing and I’m not in a good enough state, thus my health situation doesn’t allow me to take the exam.</p>\n<p>Thus I want it to be postponed, I request you to help me out, I’m in dire need of help.</p>",
