        "id": 706285,
        "name": "Swati Jain",
        "username": "21f3000759",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/21f3000759/{size}/23528_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:25:20.670Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/24f3004611\">@24f3004611</a></p>\n<p>As said in the Mega Thread we cannot postpone OPPE you have to write to support!</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-ds-students\" data-username=\"21f3000759\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"192967\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://dub1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/21f3000759/48/23528_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"><a href=\"/t/192967/1\">On another topic</a></div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Cannot attend exam tomorrow - Mail support from <a href=\"https://study-supportdesk.freshdesk.com/support/login\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">HERE</a> from student id with proper proof. Don’t post here. Note: Second OPPE is more difficult!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Get well soon!</p>\n<p>Thanks &amp; Regards,<br>\nSwati Jain</p>",
